Value NEIGHBOR (\S+)
Value LOCAL_INTERFACE (\S+)
Value NEIGHBOR_INTERFACE ([\w/.-]+(?:\s+\d+(?:/\d+)*(?:\.\d+)?)?|\S+)
Value CAPABILITY ([A-Z,\s]+)
Value AGING_TIME (.*)

Start
  ^Capability\s+codes:
  ^System\s+Name\s+Local\s+Intf
  ^${NEIGHBOR}\s+${LOCAL_INTERFACE}\s{2,}${NEIGHBOR_INTERFACE}\s{2,}${CAPABILITY}\s{2,}${AGING_TIME}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^${NEIGHBOR}\s+${LOCAL_INTERFACE}\s+${NEIGHBOR_INTERFACE}\s+${CAPABILITY}\s+${AGING_TIME}\s*$$ -> Record
